{"logId": "453d3f92-0710-498d-8be7-2f5084cddd87", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——居家", "block_bbox": [165, 140, 455, 173], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 140.0], [455.0, 140.0], [455.0, 173.0], [165.0, 173.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、根据个人喜好布置房间，把家装扮成自己喜欢的样子（色调、物件、植物、居家用品等），增加家的温馨和幸福感", "block_bbox": [181, 215, 1014, 270], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[181.0, 215.0], [1014.0, 215.0], [1014.0, 270.0], [181.0, 270.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、私家车辆", "block_bbox": [184, 275, 293, 298], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[184.0, 275.0], [292.0, 275.0], [292.0, 297.0], [184.0, 297.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）保持车辆内整洁、无杂乱", "block_bbox": [195, 303, 434, 327], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[195.0, 303.0], [434.0, 303.0], [434.0, 327.0], [195.0, 327.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）定期洗车，保持外观基本干净", "block_bbox": [194, 332, 470, 357], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[194.0, 332.0], [470.0, 332.0], [470.0, 357.0], [194.0, 357.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）每辆车必须配备车载灭火器、警示牌、两把多功能破窗器", "block_bbox": [193, 362, 685, 386], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[193.0, 362.0], [685.0, 362.0], [685.0, 386.0], [193.0, 386.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（4）无“保平安”“一帆风顺”“生肖”等影响安全驾驶的挂坠挂饰", "block_bbox": [193, 391, 738, 416], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[193.0, 391.0], [738.0, 391.0], [738.0, 416.0], [193.0, 416.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（5）摩托车、电动车刹车等无安全故障，必备头盔、反光带或反光背心", "block_bbox": [194, 420, 756, 445], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[194.0, 420.0], [756.0, 420.0], [756.0, 445.0], [194.0, 445.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（6）车辆内部不允许加坐垫套装，可配备质感好的脚垫", "block_bbox": [194, 449, 633, 474], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[194.0, 449.0], [633.0, 449.0], [633.0, 474.0], [194.0, 474.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（7）禁止把机动车借给家庭成员之外的人使用，或借用他人车辆", "block_bbox": [194, 480, 703, 505], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[194.0, 480.0], [703.0, 480.0], [703.0, 505.0], [194.0, 505.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "不符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [168, 546, 304, 570], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[168.0, 546.0], [304.0, 546.0], [304.0, 570.0], [168.0, 570.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、居家氛围冷、不温暖", "block_bbox": [184, 586, 383, 610], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[184.0, 586.0], [383.0, 586.0], [383.0, 610.0], [184.0, 610.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、缺乏居家概念，没有对居家生活的标准和追求", "block_bbox": [184, 615, 578, 640], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[184.0, 615.0], [578.0, 615.0], [578.0, 640.0], [184.0, 640.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、刻意证明身份地位或祈求金钱名利、福禄之类的物品，在乎面子、不讲实用", "block_bbox": [184, 645, 810, 670], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[184.0, 645.0], [810.0, 645.0], [810.0, 670.0], [184.0, 670.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "[46]", "block_bbox": [573, 716, 611, 738], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[573.0, 716.0], [610.0, 716.0], [610.0, 737.0], [573.0, 737.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——居家", "block_bbox": [205, 900, 498, 933], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[211.0, 900.0], [497.0, 900.0], [497.0, 932.0], [211.0, 932.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "四级【3~4分】：根据个人经济能力、岗位级别等达到相应的居家品味。（品味）", "block_bbox": [201, 971, 861, 996], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 971.0], [861.0, 971.0], [861.0, 996.0], [201.0, 996.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：根据个人或家庭经济收入，合理科学地规划最符合自身的居家（住房面积、住房位置、住房价格、装修品质、社区环境、居民素质等），保证居家各方面条件的匹配和心理舒适度，调整到最佳的居家状态上。", "block_bbox": [199, 1017, 1051, 1102], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 1017.0], [1051.0, 1017.0], [1051.0, 1102.0], [199.0, 1102.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [202, 1122, 319, 1145], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[202.0, 1122.0], [318.0, 1122.0], [318.0, 1144.0], [202.0, 1144.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "1、相匹配的居家品质和居家品味", "block_bbox": [219, 1154, 487, 1178], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1154.0], [487.0, 1154.0], [487.0, 1178.0], [219.0, 1178.0]]}, {"block_label": "table", "block_content": "<table><tr><td>级别</td><td>居家品质及品味</td><td>标准</td></tr><tr><td>员工</td><td>安全、舒适、生活气息</td><td>(1) 安全、舒适、分类清晰 (2) 理解生活、有生活气息</td></tr><tr><td>课级</td><td>功能、实用、温馨</td><td>(1) 居家氛围温暖、温馨，家具及窗帘、地毯、床品等装饰和谐搭配\\n(2) 注重居家的功能和实用</td></tr><tr><td>处级</td><td>简洁、健康、时尚</td><td>(1) 居家简洁、做到良好的断舍离\\n(2) 居家用品健康、时尚，有对生活品质的要求和体验</td></tr><tr><td>店级</td><td>品质、轻松、品味、休闲</td><td>(1) 居家硬装的细节品质良好、追求一定的工艺水平和标准，配备新风、中央空调等\\n(2) 居家软装简洁不复杂、整体氛围轻快明朗、灯光温馨\\n(3) 家具、卫浴、厨具等选择大品牌、经久耐用、有质感\\n(4) 居家用品健康、有品味\\n(5) 电器设备功能齐全、根据喜好有相应的休闲或娱乐（如茶台、小花园、露台、家庭影院、书吧、棋牌等）</td></tr></table>", "block_bbox": [250, 1180, 1026, 1435], "block_id": 20, "block_order": null, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[250.0, 1180.0], [1026.0, 1180.0], [1026.0, 1435.0], [250.0, 1435.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[47]", "block_bbox": [611, 1477, 650, 1498], "block_id": 21, "block_order": null, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1497.0], [611.0, 1497.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8555657267570496, "coordinate": [165, 140, 455, 173], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[165.0, 140.0], [455.0, 140.0], [455.0, 173.0], [165.0, 173.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9044398069381714, "coordinate": [181, 215, 1014, 270], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[181.0, 215.0], [1014.0, 215.0], [1014.0, 270.0], [181.0, 270.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.5306739211082458, "coordinate": [184, 275, 293, 298], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[184.0, 275.0], [292.0, 275.0], [292.0, 297.0], [184.0, 297.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7911708354949951, "coordinate": [195, 303, 434, 327], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[195.0, 303.0], [434.0, 303.0], [434.0, 327.0], [195.0, 327.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8234448432922363, "coordinate": [194, 332, 470, 357], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[194.0, 332.0], [470.0, 332.0], [470.0, 357.0], [194.0, 357.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8245749473571777, "coordinate": [193, 362, 685, 386], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[193.0, 362.0], [685.0, 362.0], [685.0, 386.0], [193.0, 386.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8121786713600159, "coordinate": [193, 391, 738, 416], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[193.0, 391.0], [738.0, 391.0], [738.0, 416.0], [193.0, 416.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.82261061668396, "coordinate": [194, 420, 756, 445], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[194.0, 420.0], [756.0, 420.0], [756.0, 445.0], [194.0, 445.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8348084092140198, "coordinate": [194, 449, 633, 474], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[194.0, 449.0], [633.0, 449.0], [633.0, 474.0], [194.0, 474.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8252201676368713, "coordinate": [194, 480, 703, 505], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[194.0, 480.0], [703.0, 480.0], [703.0, 505.0], [194.0, 505.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8303335905075073, "coordinate": [168, 546, 304, 570], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[168.0, 546.0], [304.0, 546.0], [304.0, 570.0], [168.0, 570.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8185610771179199, "coordinate": [184, 586, 383, 610], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[184.0, 586.0], [383.0, 586.0], [383.0, 610.0], [184.0, 610.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8303279876708984, "coordinate": [184, 615, 578, 640], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[184.0, 615.0], [578.0, 615.0], [578.0, 640.0], [184.0, 640.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.838058590888977, "coordinate": [184, 645, 810, 670], "order": 14, "polygon_points": [[184.0, 645.0], [810.0, 645.0], [810.0, 670.0], [184.0, 670.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6551144123077393, "coordinate": [573, 716, 611, 738], "order": 15, "polygon_points": [[573.0, 716.0], [610.0, 716.0], [610.0, 737.0], [573.0, 737.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8820971250534058, "coordinate": [205, 900, 498, 933], "order": 16, "polygon_points": [[211.0, 900.0], [497.0, 900.0], [497.0, 932.0], [211.0, 932.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.804780125617981, "coordinate": [201, 971, 861, 996], "order": 17, "polygon_points": [[201.0, 971.0], [861.0, 971.0], [861.0, 996.0], [201.0, 996.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9369705319404602, "coordinate": [199, 1017, 1051, 1102], "order": 18, "polygon_points": [[199.0, 1017.0], [1051.0, 1017.0], [1051.0, 1102.0], [199.0, 1102.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8303555250167847, "coordinate": [202, 1122, 319, 1145], "order": 19, "polygon_points": [[202.0, 1122.0], [318.0, 1122.0], [318.0, 1144.0], [202.0, 1144.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.711124837398529, "coordinate": [219, 1154, 487, 1178], "order": 20, "polygon_points": [[219.0, 1154.0], [487.0, 1154.0], [487.0, 1178.0], [219.0, 1178.0]]}, {"cls_id": 21, "label": "table", "score": 0.9694815874099731, "coordinate": [250, 1180, 1026, 1435], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[250.0, 1180.0], [1026.0, 1180.0], [1026.0, 1435.0], [250.0, 1435.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7664802074432373, "coordinate": [611, 1477, 650, 1498], "order": 21, "polygon_points": [[611.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1497.0], [611.0, 1497.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——居家\n\n5、根据个人喜好布置房间，把家装扮成自己喜欢的样子（色调、物件、植物、居家用品等），增加家的温馨和幸福感\n\n6、私家车辆\n\n（1）保持车辆内整洁、无杂乱\n\n（2）定期洗车，保持外观基本干净\n\n（3）每辆车必须配备车载灭火器、警示牌、两把多功能破窗器\n\n（4）无“保平安”“一帆风顺”“生肖”等影响安全驾驶的挂坠挂饰\n\n（5）摩托车、电动车刹车等无安全故障，必备头盔、反光带或反光背心\n\n（6）车辆内部不允许加坐垫套装，可配备质感好的脚垫\n\n（7）禁止把机动车借给家庭成员之外的人使用，或借用他人车辆\n\n## 不符合的行为：\n\n1、居家氛围冷、不温暖\n\n2、缺乏居家概念，没有对居家生活的标准和追求\n\n3、刻意证明身份地位或祈求金钱名利、福禄之类的物品，在乎面子、不讲实用\n\n[46]\n\n## 考评奖励标准——居家\n\n## 四 级【3~4分】：根据个人经济能力、岗位级别等达到相应的居家品味。（品味）\n\n- 本条释义：根据个人或家庭经济收入，合理科学地规划最符合自身的居家（住房面积、住房位置、住房价格、装修品质、社区环境、居民素质等），保证居家各方面条件的匹配和心理舒适度，调整到最佳的居家状态上。\n\n## 符合的行为：\n\n## 1、 相匹配的居家品质和居家品味\n\n\n<table border=1 style='margin: auto; word-wrap: break-word;'><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>级别</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>居家品质及品味</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>标准</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>员工</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>安全、舒适、生活气息</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>(1) 安全、舒适、分类清晰 (2) 理解生活、有生活气息</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>课级</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>功能、实用、温馨</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>(1) 居家氛围温暖、温馨，家具及窗帘、地毯、床品等装饰和谐搭配\\n(2) 注重居家的功能和实用</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>处级</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>简洁、健康、时尚</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>(1) 居家简洁、做到良好的断舍离\\n(2) 居家用品健康、时尚，有对生活品质的要求和体验</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>店级</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>品质、轻松、品味、休闲</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>(1) 居家硬装的细节品质良好、追求一定的工艺水平和标准，配备新风、中央空调等\\n(2) 居家软装简洁不复杂、整体氛围轻快明朗、灯光温馨\\n(3) 家具、卫浴、厨具等选择大品牌、经久耐用、有质感\\n(4) 居家用品健康、有品味\\n(5) 电器设备功能齐全、根据喜好有相应的休闲或娱乐（如茶台、小花园、露台、家庭影院、书吧、棋牌等）</td></tr></table>", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//453d3f92-0710-498d-8be7-2f5084cddd87/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A13%3A50Z%2F-1%2F%2Ff52d9c12e7a09ed6cb49fa345b64a721ec595c98d693e17b0d1e268fa0a1e693"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//453d3f92-0710-498d-8be7-2f5084cddd87/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A13%3A50Z%2F-1%2F%2F26cedbb56af1659a141ba78a406c2231f9e1b30cc1c386d72befbd06d1294b1c"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//453d3f92-0710-498d-8be7-2f5084cddd87/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A13%3A50Z%2F-1%2F%2F26c3a624dd4d8cb76c0f867522beab0bb1748cfa91ddb0de6289683b5126d655"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
